# partner-dashboard-vue rules

- Domain: AcmePay (fictional). No StarsPay branding.
- Money: integer minor units to API. Display via `src/lib/money.ts`.
- Contract: `Docs/specs/API_CONTRACT.md`, `error-codes.md`.
- API calls in composables, not scattered in views.
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/vue-api-composable/SKILL.md`.
- Spec first → implement → Vitest → update spec checkboxes.
